# Architecture

- One repository, one Node web service, one PostgreSQL database, one browser client.
- Do not introduce microservices, a second deployable API, or a competing source of game truth.
- Layers: client presentation, transport, application services, pure game engine, persistence, declarative content.
- The engine determines truth. The interface determines presentation.
- Record irreversible choices in `docs/adr/`.
- Do not add a runtime dependency unless the pull request states a one-sentence rationale.
